    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START</strong></h2> \u2014 Welcome to Super Dungeon Muncher! Dive into a tough adventure that tests your reflexes and quick thinking!<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEEP MOVING</strong></h2> \u2014 Muncher is very hungry, and you're on the menu! Stay ahead and avoid becoming its next meal!<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GEAR UP</strong></h2> \u2014 Equip yourself with arsenal of tools to navigate obstacles, open up new paths, and take down baddies!<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER</strong></h2> \u2014 Persist through to unveil new lands and secrets on your journey!<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCKABLE CHARACTERS</strong></h2> \u2014 Complete quests and master challenges to unlock 20 unique characters, each with their own abilities and playstyles! <br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY</strong></h2> \u2014 Support for keyboard, gamepad and touch-screen controls!</li></ul><br><i>SUPER Dungeon Muncher is a challenging runner that combines rogue-like elements and puzzle solving - The titular Muncher chases you in real-time, while your  movements are turn-based and restricted to a grid! Can you outrun the hungry menace?</i>",
